        {
          "id": 2603365000,
          "type": null,
          "body": "At some point, perhaps, [a version of] this flag may be needed when cross-compiling (clang/llvm appears to add the flag if needed [automatically](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/4d57159c09b226a5608a26c1bc57f7b66cb80a24) but gcc/binutils [perhaps not](https://sourceware.org/legacy-ml/binutils/2014-03/msg00110.html). I suppose we can cross that bridge when we come to it, as the MSYS2 builds don't seem to be failing at github right now.",
